听说过，那一族对自然环境的变化尤为敏锐。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1121227005:1":{"key":"say:5:1121227005:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1121227005","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"没错，他们的族长甚至早就预知到了腐化会为薄暮丛林和瓦度...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1121227006:0":{"key":"say:6:1121227006:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1121227006","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"阿尔法十一在港口预知了暴雨将至！雅顿贤者，她果然就是阿...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1121227007:0":{"key":"say:7:1121227007:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1121227007","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"是不是呢……虽然外貌很像，但是她们给我的感觉并不相同。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:12:1121227008:0":{"key":"say:12:1121227008:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1121227008","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"雅顿贤者，我打算直接带阿尔法十一去找她的族人。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_ti